<title>GHANA: SOCCER-AFRICAN CLUB COMPETITION RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AFRICAN CLUB COMPETITION RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ACCRA 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of second round, second leg matches in African club soccer competitions:</p>
<p>Played Sunday:</p>
<p>Champions' Cup</p>
<p>In Obuasi, Ghana: Goldfields (Ghana) 2 El-Hilal (Sudan) 0 (halftime 2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Joe Okyere 2, Owusu Ansah 30 penalty</p>
<p>Attendance: 15,000</p>
<p>Goldfields won 3-2 on aggregate</p>
</text>
